                                    <div role="main" id="mc-main-content">
                                        <h1 class="script-category">Miscellaneous script steps</h1>
                                        <p>Miscellaneous script steps allow you to script miscellaneous actions.</p>
                                        <p class="tip" data-mc-autonum="&lt;b&gt;Tip &#160;&lt;/b&gt;"><span class="autonumber"><span><b>Tip &#160;</b></span></span>Use the Comment script step to annotate your scripts so your colleagues can understand them.</p>
                                        <table class="TableStyle-StandardTable" style="mc-table-style: url(''resources/tablestyles/standardtable.css'');" cellspacing="0">
                                            <tbody>
                                                <tr class="TableStyle-StandardTable-Body-Body1">
                                                    <td class="TableStyle-StandardTable-BodyE-Column1-Body1">
                                                        <p><a href="comment.html"># (Comment)</a></p>
                                                    </td>
                                                    <td class="TableStyle-StandardTable-BodyD-Column1-Body1">
                                                        <p>Adds comments to the list of steps in the script.</p>
                                                    </td>
                                                </tr>
                                                <tr class="TableStyle-StandardTable-Body-Body1">
                                                    <td class="TableStyle-StandardTable-BodyE-Column1-Body1">
                                                        <p><a href="allow-formatting-bar.html">Allow Formatting Bar</a></p>
                                                    </td>
                                                    <td class="TableStyle-StandardTable-BodyD-Column1-Body1">
                                                        <p>Enables or disables display of the formatting bar.</p>
                                                    </td>
                                                </tr>
                                                <tr class="TableStyle-StandardTable-Body-Body1">
                                                    <td class="TableStyle-StandardTable-BodyE-Column1-Body1">
                                                        <p><a href="avplayer-play.html">AVPlayer Play</a></p>
                                                    </td>
                                                    <td class="TableStyle-StandardTable-BodyD-Column1-Body1">
                                                        <p>Plays audio, video, or images from a container field, layout object, or URL.</p>
                                                    </td>
                                                </tr>
                                                <tr class="TableStyle-StandardTable-Body-Body1">
                                                    <td class="TableStyle-StandardTable-BodyE-Column1-Body1">
                                                        <p><a href="avplayer-set-options.html">AVPlayer Set Options</a></p>
                                                    </td>
                                                    <td class="TableStyle-StandardTable-BodyD-Column1-Body1">
                                                        <p>Changes the settings for a media file that is playing or is paused.</p>
                                                    </td>
                                                </tr>
                                                <tr class="TableStyle-StandardTable-Body-Body1">
                                                    <td class="TableStyle-StandardTable-BodyE-Column1-Body1">
                                                        <p><a href="avplayer-set-playback-state.html">AVPlayer Set Playback State</a></p>
                                                    </td>
                                                    <td class="TableStyle-StandardTable-BodyD-Column1-Body1">
                                                        <p>Pauses, resumes, or stops playing a media file that is playing or is paused.</p>
                                                    </td>
                                                </tr>
                                                <tr class="TableStyle-StandardTable-Body-Body1">
                                                    <td class="TableStyle-StandardTable-BodyE-Column1-Body1">
                                                        <p><a href="beep.html">Beep</a></p>
                                                    </td>
                                                    <td class="TableStyle-StandardTable-BodyD-Column1-Body1">
                                                        <p>Plays a system beep sound.</p>
                                                    </td>
                                                </tr>
                                                <tr class="TableStyle-StandardTable-Body-Body1">
                                                    <td class="TableStyle-StandardTable-BodyE-Column1-Body1">
                                                        <p><a href="dial-phone.html">Dial Phone</a></p>
                                                    </td>
                                                    <td class="TableStyle-StandardTable-BodyD-Column1-Body1">
                                                        <p>Dials a phone from within a script.</p>
                                                    </td>
                                                </tr>
                                                <tr class="TableStyle-StandardTable-Body-Body1">
                                                    <td class="TableStyle-StandardTable-BodyE-Column1-Body1">
                                                        <p><a href="enable-touch-keyboard.html">Enable Touch Keyboard</a></p>
                                                    </td>
                                                    <td class="TableStyle-StandardTable-BodyD-Column1-Body1">
                                                        <p>Enables or disables the touch keyboard.</p>
                                                    </td>
                                                </tr>
                                                <tr class="TableStyle-StandardTable-Body-Body1">
                                                    <td class="TableStyle-StandardTable-BodyE-Column1-Body1">
                                                        <p><a href="execute-filemaker-data-api.html">Execute FileMaker Data API</a></p>
                                                    </td>
                                                    <td class="TableStyle-StandardTable-BodyD-Column1-Body1">
                                                        <p>Executes a FileMaker Data API request.</p>
                                                    </td>
                                                </tr>
                                                <tr class="TableStyle-StandardTable-Body-Body1">
                                                    <td class="TableStyle-StandardTable-BodyE-Column1-Body1">
                                                        <p><a href="execute-sql.html">Execute SQL</a></p>
                                                    </td>
                                                    <td class="TableStyle-StandardTable-BodyD-Column1-Body1">
                                                        <p>Executes any SQL statement on an ODBC data source.</p>
                                                    </td>
                                                </tr>
                                                <tr class="TableStyle-StandardTable-Body-Body1">
                                                    <td class="TableStyle-StandardTable-BodyE-Column1-Body1">
                                                        <p><a href="exit-application.html">Exit Application</a></p>
                                                    </td>
                                                    <td class="TableStyle-StandardTable-BodyD-Column1-Body1">
                                                        <p>Closes all open files; and in FileMaker Pro, exits the application.</p>
                                                    </td>
                                                </tr>
                                                <tr class="TableStyle-StandardTable-Body-Body1">
                                                    <td class="TableStyle-StandardTable-BodyE-Column1-Body1">
                                                        <p><a href="flush-cache-to-disk.html">Flush Cache to Disk</a></p>
                                                    </td>
                                                    <td class="TableStyle-StandardTable-BodyD-Column1-Body1">
                                                        <p>Immediately flushes the internal file cache to the computer''s hard disk.</p>
                                                    </td>
                                                </tr>
                                                <tr class="TableStyle-StandardTable-Body-Body1">
                                                    <td class="TableStyle-StandardTable-BodyE-Column1-Body1">
                                                        <p><a href="flush-web-viewer-cookies.html">Flush Web Viewer Cookies</a></p>
                                                    </td>
                                                    <td class="TableStyle-StandardTable-BodyD-Column1-Body1">
                                                        <p>Immediately flushes all web viewer cookies used in the FileMaker client.</p>
                                                    </td>
                                                </tr>
                                                <tr class="TableStyle-StandardTable-Body-Body1">
                                                    <td class="TableStyle-StandardTable-BodyE-Column1-Body1">
                                                        <p><a href="get-directory.html">Get Folder Path</a></p>
                                                    </td>
                                                    <td class="TableStyle-StandardTable-BodyD-Column1-Body1">
                                                        <p>Sets a variable to the fully qualified path of a specified folder.</p>
                                                    </td>
                                                </tr>
                                                <tr class="TableStyle-StandardTable-Body-Body1">
                                                    <td class="TableStyle-StandardTable-BodyE-Column1-Body1">
                                                        <p><a href="install-menu-set.html">Install Menu Set</a></p>
                                                    </td>
                                                    <td class="TableStyle-StandardTable-BodyD-Column1-Body1">
                                                        <p>Changes the menu set based on conditions established in the script.</p>
                                                    </td>
                                                </tr>
                                                <tr class="TableStyle-StandardTable-Body-Body1">
                                                    <td class="TableStyle-StandardTable-BodyE-Column1-Body1">
                                                        <p><a href="install-plug-in-file.html">Install Plug-In File</a></p>
                                                    </td>
                                                    <td class="TableStyle-StandardTable-BodyD-Column1-Body1">
                                                        <p>Installs or updates a plug-in file from a container field onto your computer.</p>
                                                    </td>
                                                </tr>
                                                <tr class="TableStyle-StandardTable-Body-Body1">
                                                    <td class="TableStyle-StandardTable-BodyE-Column1-Body1">
                                                        <p><a href="open-url.html">Open URL</a></p>
                                                    </td>
                                                    <td class="TableStyle-StandardTable-BodyD-Column1-Body1">
                                                        <p>Allows the user to open a URL.</p>
                                                    </td>
                                                </tr>
                                                <tr class="TableStyle-StandardTable-Body-Body1">
                                                    <td class="TableStyle-StandardTable-BodyE-Column1-Body1">
                                                        <p><a href="perform-applescript-os-x.html">Perform AppleScript (macOS)</a></p>
                                                    </td>
                                                    <td class="TableStyle-StandardTable-BodyD-Column1-Body1">
                                                        <p>Sends AppleScript commands to another application.</p>
                                                    </td>
                                                </tr>
                                                <tr class="TableStyle-StandardTable-Body-Body1">
                                                    <td class="TableStyle-StandardTable-BodyE-Column1-Body1">
                                                        <p><a href="perform-javascript-in-web-viewer.html">Perform JavaScript in Web Viewer</a></p>
                                                    </td>
                                                    <td class="TableStyle-StandardTable-BodyD-Column1-Body1">
                                                        <p>Performs a JavaScript function in a web viewer.</p>
                                                    </td>
                                                </tr>
                                                <tr class="TableStyle-StandardTable-Body-Body1">
                                                    <td class="TableStyle-StandardTable-BodyE-Column1-Body1">
                                                        <p><a href="refresh-object.html">Refresh Object</a></p>
                                                    </td>
                                                    <td class="TableStyle-StandardTable-BodyD-Column1-Body1">
                                                        <p>Updates the contents, conditional formatting, and visibility state of the specified object.</p>
                                                    </td>
                                                </tr>
                                                <tr class="TableStyle-StandardTable-Body-Body1">
                                                    <td class="TableStyle-StandardTable-BodyE-Column1-Body1">
                                                        <p><a href="refresh-portal.html">Refresh Portal</a></p>
                                                    </td>
                                                    <td class="TableStyle-StandardTable-BodyD-Column1-Body1">
                                                        <p>Refreshes the relationship and contents of the named object.</p>
                                                    </td>
                                                </tr>
                                                <tr class="TableStyle-StandardTable-Body-Body1">
                                                    <td class="TableStyle-StandardTable-BodyE-Column1-Body1">
                                                        <p><a href="save-a-copy-as-add-on-package.html">Save a Copy as Add-on Package</a></p>
                                                    </td>
                                                    <td class="TableStyle-StandardTable-BodyD-Column1-Body1">
                                                        <p>Creates an add-on package from a FileMaker Pro file.</p>
                                                    </td>
                                                </tr>
                                                <tr class="TableStyle-StandardTable-Body-Body1">
                                                    <td class="TableStyle-StandardTable-BodyE-Column1-Body1">
                                                        <p><a href="send-dde-execute-windows.html">Send DDE Execute (Windows)</a></p>
                                                    </td>
                                                    <td class="TableStyle-StandardTable-BodyD-Column1-Body1">
                                                        <p>Sends a DDE command to another application to execute commands in that application.</p>
                                                    </td>
                                                </tr>
                                                <tr class="TableStyle-StandardTable-Body-Body1">
                                                    <td class="TableStyle-StandardTable-BodyE-Column1-Body1">
                                                        <p><a href="send-event.html">Send Event</a></p>
                                                    </td>
                                                    <td class="TableStyle-StandardTable-BodyD-Column1-Body1">
                                                        <p>In Windows, performs an action in another application; in macOS, sends an Apple event to another application.</p>
                                                    </td>
                                                </tr>
                                                <tr class="TableStyle-StandardTable-Body-Body1">
                                                    <td class="TableStyle-StandardTable-BodyE-Column1-Body1">
                                                        <p><a href="send-mail.html">Send Mail</a></p>
                                                    </td>
                                                    <td class="TableStyle-StandardTable-BodyD-Column1-Body1">
                                                        <p>Sends an email message through an email application or via SMTP.</p>
                                                    </td>
                                                </tr>
                                                <tr class="TableStyle-StandardTable-Body-Body1">
                                                    <td class="TableStyle-StandardTable-BodyE-Column1-Body1">
                                                        <p><a href="set-session-identifier.html">Set Session Identifier</a></p>
                                                    </td>
                                                    <td class="TableStyle-StandardTable-BodyD-Column1-Body1">
                                                        <p>Sets an identifier for the user''s current session.</p>
                                                    </td>
                                                </tr>
                                                <tr class="TableStyle-StandardTable-Body-Body1">
                                                    <td class="TableStyle-StandardTable-BodyE-Column1-Body1">
                                                        <p><a href="set-web-viewer.html">Set Web Viewer</a></p>
                                                    </td>
                                                    <td class="TableStyle-StandardTable-BodyD-Column1-Body1">
                                                        <p>Controls the specified web viewer.</p>
                                                    </td>
                                                </tr>
                                                <tr class="TableStyle-StandardTable-Body-Body1">
                                                    <td class="TableStyle-StandardTable-BodyE-Column1-Body1">
                                                        <p><a href="show-custom-dialog.html">Show Custom Dialog</a></p>
                                                    </td>
                                                    <td class="TableStyle-StandardTable-BodyD-Column1-Body1">
                                                        <p>Displays a custom message dialog box, with custom text and labels.</p>
                                                    </td>
                                                </tr>
                                                <tr class="TableStyle-StandardTable-Body-Body1">
                                                    <td class="TableStyle-StandardTable-BodyB-Column1-Body1">
                                                        <p><a href="speak-os-x.html">Speak (macOS)</a></p>
                                                    </td>
                                                    <td class="TableStyle-StandardTable-BodyA-Column1-Body1">
                                                        <p>Produces speech from text.</p>
                                                    </td>
                                                </tr>
                                            </tbody>
                                        </table>
